  "$comment": [
    "Cross-engine golden for dmath (DET-5). Regenerating this file is an",
    "engineVersion-level event: if the digest below changes, every state hash",
    "in the repo changes with it, because expansion angles feed every pose.",
    "`digest` is what tools/dmath-digest.mjs prints; verify-engine.mjs runs that",
    "file under Node (V8) and, when the binary is present, under JavaScriptCore",
    "— the WebKit leg of the browser triple — and requires both to match this.",
    "`spots` are IEEE-754 bit patterns (hex, high word first) for the angles",
    "real scenes are built from, so a regression names an angle rather than just",
    "moving a checksum."
